Hi,
 I would like to post a rather shameless plug for some Rhipe related stuff I've been working on:
A review post <http://blog.piccolboni.info/2011/04/looking-for-map-reduce-language.html> about map-reduce programming languages or libraries, where Rhipe comes out as my favorite (not the best for everything, just under my own criteria). Also syndicated on the dataspora blog.
A post <http://blog.piccolboni.info/2011/04/bringing-relational-joins-to-rhipe.html> about implementing relational joins in Rhipe
A post <http://blog.piccolboni.info/2011/04/map-reduce-algorithm-for-connected.html> about solving connected components in Rhipe
I hope you enjoy them and please do not hesitate with feedback. Thanks to Fishtank for being supportive in multiple instances and for creating Rhipe.

Antonio

